        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Am I only allowed to use 1 Aspect per Spirit per game, or can I use as many as I want, provided none of them replace the same Innate Power/Special Rule?\n\nFor example, if I’m playing Lightning’s Swift Strike, could I use all of the following Aspects?\n* [Pandemonium](https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=Pandemonium), which replaces Lightning’s Innate Power.\n* [Wind](https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=Wind), which replaces Lightning’s Special Rule.\n* [Immense](https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=Immense), which doesn’t replace anything.\n\nAnother example would be River Surges in Sunlight with both [Sunshine](https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=Sunshine) and [Travel](https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=Travel). However, as all of the Aspects of both Vital Strength of the Earth and Shadows Flicker Like Flame replace those Spirits’ Special Rules, the two above examples would be the only legal ones (as of yet).",
